  "description": "The Hyperfly is the first Nukeproof to be raced at the highest level in Cross Country - UCI World Cups, under the KMC Nukeproof Team on their journey to LA28. Featuring a full carbon fibre flex pivot frame with 120mm of travel that weighs only 1674gr (unpainted size M, hardware included, excluding shock), Hyperfly earns its name as a hyper light, super fast race rig that is equally capable smashing lap times on your local single track as it is of getting you on the podium. If speed is what you're looking for, in a bike that will still be fun to ride and not buck you off at the first drop, the 66.6 degree head tube angle will confirm that this bike is indeed...a total beast!",
